      <title>教师入门Trae：怎么找好用的Skills、怎么让Skills帮你干活</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/edudaily/post/20260816/%E6%95%99%E5%B8%88%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8Trae%E6%80%8E%E4%B9%88%E6%89%BE%E5%A5%BD%E7%94%A8%E7%9A%84Skills%E6%80%8E%E4%B9%88%E8%AE%A9Skills%E5%B8%AE%E4%BD%A0%E5%B9%B2%E6%B4%BB/</link>
